WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.712
Puffs of smoke came from Poppy.

2
00:00:11.713 --> 00:00:14.977
The smoke was gray.

3
00:00:14.978 --> 00:00:18.122
"Yuck!" said Jeb.

4
00:00:18.123 --> 00:00:21.633
"That smoke smells terrible!"

5
00:00:21.634 --> 00:00:25.198
"Poppy!" said Ms. Fender.

6
00:00:25.199 --> 00:00:27.720
"Come to the garage now.

7
00:00:27.721 --> 00:00:30.386
You need a repair."

8
00:00:30.387 --> 00:00:33.410
"No thanks," said Poppy.

9
00:00:33.411 --> 00:00:38.464
"I'm fine!"

10
00:00:38.465 --> 00:00:41.426
Poppy tried to chase her friends.

11
00:00:41.427 --> 00:00:45.585
But now Poppy had more smoke.

12
00:00:45.586 --> 00:00:48.207
The smoke was thick.

13
00:00:48.208 --> 00:00:53.937
It turned black.

14
00:00:53.938 --> 00:00:56.922
Eddy coughed.

15
00:00:56.923 --> 00:01:00.804
Jeb coughed.

16
00:01:00.805 --> 00:01:04.364
Dipper coughed.

17
00:01:04.365 --> 00:01:08.084
"Poppy!" called Ms. Fender

18
00:01:08.085 --> 00:01:11.185
"Come over here!"

19
00:01:11.186 --> 00:01:14.967
Poppy didn't listen.

20
00:01:14.968 --> 00:01:22.265
She kept playing.

21
00:01:22.266 --> 00:01:25.435
Poppy tried to drive fast.

22
00:01:25.436 --> 00:01:28.916
But she made even more smoke.

23
00:01:28.917 --> 00:01:31.760
Putt, putt, putt.

24
00:01:31.761 --> 00:01:35.346
Poppy went slower and slower.

25
00:01:35.347 --> 00:01:39.836
Finally she rolled to a stop.

26
00:01:39.837 --> 00:01:43.305
"Uh-oh," cried Poppy.

27
00:01:43.306 --> 00:01:47.654
"I'm out of gas!"

